    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Going shopping",
     "texto": [
      "**Comprare** is a regular -are verb: **compro, compri, compra, compriamo**.",
      "The «noi» (we) form is also used to suggest things: **Compriamo la frutta?** (shall we buy fruit?), **Andiamo al supermercato** (let's go to the supermarket).",
      "**Fare la spesa** = to do the shopping."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
